OL,3,GNEWSAStaff strike at four Greater
OL,4,AManchester hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of operating theatre staff are
OL,7,Fset to strike next week at four Greater
OL,8,FManchester hospitals.
OL,10,FMore than 350 employees including
OL,11,Fnurses, clinical support workers and
OL,12,Fhousekeepers from Salford Royal
OL,13,FHospital, Royal Oldham Hospital,
OL,14,FRochdale Infirmary and Fairfield
OL,15,FHospital in Bury will strike on Monday
OL,16,F24 August, Wednesday 26 August and
OL,17,FFriday 28 August.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
