OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStaff strike at four Greater
OL,4,AManchester hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrade union Unison claimed an offer by
OL,7,FNorthern Care Alliance Foundation Trust
OL,8,F(NCA) to resolve a dispute was
OL,9,Finitially tabled by NCA bosses, but
OL,10,Fwithdrawn before discussions could take
OL,11,Fplace.
OL,13,FGertie Nic Philib, the trust's chief
OL,14,Fpeople and strategy officer said: "We
OL,15,Frespect our colleagues' right to take
OL,16,Flawful industrial action."
